<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 68.7710 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 68.7710 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge rose to 68.7710 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 68.7998 on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Sep 16		  Sep 13</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     68.7710		 68.7998</p>
<p> volume ($ million)		  0.515		   1.170</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 45.6200		 45.6680</p>
<p> volume (DM million)		 0.020		   0.050</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
